                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Jeremy Kerr",
                        "email": "jk@ozlabs.org",
                        "username": "jk-ozlabs"
                    },
                    "message": "I have a few thoughts/review items on the driver itself, but unsure of the best way to review those (or whether this is the appropriate time to do so, given the WIP status).\n\nIs this intended for upstream? If so, the netdev list may be best. If not, perhaps sending the actual patch to the openbmc list?"
                },
                {
                    "file": "/PATCHSET_LEVEL",
                    "line": 0,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Ed Tanous",
                        "email": "ed@tanous.net",
                        "username": "edtanous"
                    },
                    "message": "honestly, this was pulled from our internal repos as is (I haven't even fully reviewed it).  Absolutely I will push to netnext it if we end up going this direction versus just userspace tap.\n\nThis WIP was more to start discussions internally (look, just applying the patch doesn't work) around what we wanted to push than it was to incite comments.  If there's pieces here that you think would be immediately useful, we I can break them down and send them not as a drop."
                }
